cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these models, you can cite this repository (optional: the models are in the public domain)."
title: "Scitizia Landmarks 64: 17 low poly Brazilian landmarks in glTF/GLB"
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Kayque
    family-names: Rotondo
    alias: kayquer
repository-code: "https://github.com/kayquer/scitizia-monumentos-64"
url: "https://github.com/kayquer/scitizia-monumentos-64"
license: CC0-1.0
date-released: "2026-11-26"
abstract: "17 famous Brazilian landmarks modeled in low poly with a retro 64-bit console look (Christ the Redeemer, Sugarloaf Mountain, Maracanã, Cathedral of Brasília, Amazon Theatre and more), one binary glTF 2.0 file each, at approximate real-world scale, with vertex colors and no textures, plus previews and a JSON catalog."
keywords:
